    "# COGS 108 - Data Checkpoint"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Names\n",
    "\n",
    "- Lavin Ma\n",
    "- Katie Ngo\n",
    "- Preity Singh\n",
    "- Thatcher Eames\n",
    "- Krrish Jain"
   ]
  },
